      "hidden": false,
      "icon": "/enemies-icons/Thirster.webp",
      "flavour_text": "It once bore an Iberian name, until it tossed that name into the sea and disappeared into the abyss. However, embracing the seawater was not enough to moisten its parched throat, and the clear red liquid flowing within its veins is equally enticing, so it has returned to dry land once more, thirstier than ever.",
